<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div><font face="arial">{!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div><font face="arial">You recently reached out to my department in search of information about a graduate degree program in the <a href="https://chs.asu.edu/programs/graduate">College of Health Solutions</a> at Arizona State University. I attempted to contact you, but my emails may have gone to your junk folder so I am reaching out again to find out if you are still interested.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">Do you plan to apply for the upcoming academic year? Please reply so I can keep your record up to date. If you are no longer interested, I will close your file. If you remain interested, I hope you'll contact me soon to set up a call. We can discuss your personal goals, and explore how a graduate degree can help you take the next step in your career.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">I hope to hear from you soon.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Sincerely,&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Email}</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>